            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arababwira ati “Ntimuzabura kunciraho uyu mugani muti ‘Muvuzi, wivure. Ibyo twumvise byose ko wakoze i Kaperinawumu, bikore n'ino mu mudugudu wanyu.’ ” ",
